title: "evidence-closed-loop: reference implementation for \"Evidence-coupled bistability converts dependency structure into a recovery geometry\""
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for the manuscript "Evidence-coupled bistability
  converts dependency structure into a recovery geometry". The single script
  verifies every theorem and proposition reported in the manuscript, prints each
  quoted value beside its computed value, and regenerates every display item.
